# Beyond the Sun (jeuno 76): Maat in Ru'Lude Gardens (the first of that name; default MAAT_DIALOG). Shattering Stars
# completed and maatsCap holding the fifteen original jobs (32767; both by GM), a level 66 Warrior. Available: a stone
# (no trade handler: nothing); 74 answered with a full bag (Maat's Cap cannot be given: not completed; the finish
# ignores it); 74 again (completed: Maat's Cap, Ultimate Champion of the World). Completed (maatsCap still full): 78 (1)
# (the completed section reads no maatsCap); a stone: nothing.
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/74
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WAR lvl=66
quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars completed
charvar maatsCap 32767
item FlintStone
login
trade Maat FlintStone x1                # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Maat                            # all fifteen jobs: 74
fill-inventory
finish                                  # no room for Maat's Cap: not completed
free-inventory
trigger Maat                            # still available: 74
finish                                  # completed: Maat's Cap, Ultimate Champion of the World
trigger Maat                            # completed, an original job at 66: 78 (1)
finish
trade Maat FlintStone x1                # completed: nothing
